msgid ""
"Your files in Windows (%1) don't fit next to Monet. Open them from Files once Monet is installed."
msgstr ""
"Je bestanden in Windows (%1) passen niet naast Monet. Open ze vanuit Bestanden zodra Monet is geïnstalleerd."

